  (text "RX_0 / TX_0 are reserved for future use.\nPreferred feeder bus candidate: P2.11, pin 52.\nP0.23 / AD0.0, pin 9: RESERVED vacuum head 1.\nP0.24 / AD0.1, pin 8: RESERVED vacuum head 2.\nP1.30 / AD0.4, pin 21: RESERVED pump vacuum.\nSensors: XGZP6847A100KPGN33, 3.3V analog.\nPin and timing availability still require a firmware audit.\nNC means isolated in CAM, not validated on hardware.\nDo not infer 5V tolerance for analog sensor operation."
